SUMMARY:Members Discovery Series: Skye Consort & Emma Björling
LOCATION:Parlor Room\, 32 Masonic St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:Skye Consort & Emma Björling perform whirling polskas\, groovy
  reels\, passionate love songs and breathtaking hymns all found in or insp
 ired by music from Scandinavia\, The British Isles\, French Canada and the
  New World. Their trans-Atlantic arrangements and original compositions sp
 ring from an extraordinary collaboration consisting of voices\, fiddle\, n
 yckelharpa\, cello\, bouzouki\, banjo\, and percussion. Each musician brin
 gs their individual passion to both traditional practices and inventive mu
 sic-making.\nhttps://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events
 /a0SV500000C8HMXMA3\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/weste
