  the Grateful Dead Featuring Jeffrey Pepper Rodgers\, Jefferson Hamer\, St
 eve Roy\, and Wendy Sassafras Ramsay Dead to the Core is a collective of s
 inger-songwriters and acoustic musicians\, led by musician/author Jeffrey 
