 artet of world-class performers led by guitarist and vocalist Tony Silva\,
  whose love and dedication to music of the Spanish diaspora has earned him
  well-deserved praise for nearly 20 years. Performing Rumba Flamenca\, the
  party version of Flamenco (made famous by the Gypsy Kings)\, the group’
 s rhythms blend Spanish\, Cuban and South American influences with fiery s
 olos and onstage charisma that invite you to dance\, clap\, and celebrate.
